---
// ImageToPdfHero.astro - Hero Section para a página de Imagem para PDF
---

<section class="relative pt-8 pb-8 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-12 overflow-hidden mesh-gradient-bg border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
  <!-- Grid background decorativo -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#00000008_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#00000008_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-[var(--color-mute)] mb-6 font-mono" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-[var(--color-ink)] transition-colors">Início</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--color-ink)] font-medium">Imagem para PDF</span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Top Badge / Trust Pill -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-canvas)] border border-[var(--color-hairline)] shadow-2xs mb-6 text-xs text-[var(--color-body)]">
      <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
      </span>
      <span class="font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]">100% Privado no Navegador</span>
      <span class="text-[var(--color-hairline-strong)]">|</span>
      <span>Sem Marca d'Água & Grátis</span>
    </div>

    <!-- H1 Headline -->
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[var(--color-ink)] leading-[1.1] max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      Converter Imagem para PDF <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="mesh-gradient-text">Grátis & Sem Limites</span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="mt-5 text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--color-body)] leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Junte fotos <strong>JPG, PNG e WebP</strong> em um único documento PDF em segundos. Reordene páginas, gire fotos, ajuste margens e gere PDFs em alta resolução sem enviar seus dados para servidores externos.
    </p>

    <!-- Quick Trust Stats -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-8 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--color-mute)]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Zero Upload (LGPD)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Múltiplas Fotos em 1 PDF</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Formato A4, Carta & Auto</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
          <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
        </svg>
        <span>Download Imediato</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
